{
  "_doc": "Every item in the game. pickups: dropped in a run and collected by walking near (pickups.radius x magnet in run_config.json). buffs: temporary buffs that appear at random near the player (timing in run_config.json buffs) and run for duration s once walked onto; effects work like upgrade effects (PlayerStats), invulnerable blocks all damage, color = HUD timer bar; aura = status sprite drawn around the hero meanwhile (made for the hero: same 48 px frame and feet anchor, each buff in its own zone so auras never overlap; aura_layer back = behind the hero, front = over it, drawn in this order so the shield bubble comes last). Rarity tiers (cosmetic + power curve, buffs/equipment docs in design/buffs.md and design/equipment.md): common < rare < epic < legendary. rarity = shown colour in the gear screen and used for the drops' power level. icon = ui-icons frame. Read by src/run/run.gd and the studio dashboard (tab Vat pham). Equipment \"sub\" (dòng phụ: effects added at Cường hoá level \"at\") and \"special\" (hiệu ứng đặc biệt of legendary items, a run mechanic by \"kind\", unlocked at \"at\"): design/equipment.md.",
